<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>quick lc bm + dagger + q + duel combo with delay</Major>
    <Description>This utilizes the use of LC, one of the strongest offlaner in this patch. I added a small delay so you have the chance to react whether you are about to get disabled after using the BM+Dagger in combo. 

Duel should be in quick cast and point your cursor to your target ( I advice you to have a good vision before executing this ) 

Feel free to adjust the timing to your own accord.
Dm me @trigago on keyran forums for suggestions and feedback.

Enjoy!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 6 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyUp 6 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyDown 23 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyUp 23 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyDown 20 1
Delay 150 ms
KeyUp 20 1
Delay 150 ms
KeyDown 21 1
Delay 50 ms
KeyUp 21 1
Delay 50 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Dota 2</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>